---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: on_camera_look · 对象关系
  accDescr: 中心对象与所有直接关联对象；完整保留入边、出边及原投影和注册身份，不递归展开间接关系。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_observer fill:#F4F1F9,stroke:#7B4DB2,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_component fill:#F1F5F2,stroke:#4B8060,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_resource fill:#F8F4EE,stroke:#A5792C,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_local fill:#F8F5F1,stroke:#AA8752,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_event fill:#F9F3EE,stroke:#B66B2D,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_plugin fill:#F1F3F6,stroke:#4A6389,stroke-width:2.2px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_read stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef edge_write stroke:#2F7161,stroke-width:1.8px
  classDef edge_observe stroke:#B66B2D,stroke-width:1.8px,stroke-dasharray:2 4
  classDef edge_registration stroke:#64748B,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: hex, label: "**on_camera_look**<br/>将观察输入转为第一人称水平角与俯仰角。" }
  class n0 node_observer
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**FirstPersonCamera**<br/>保存跟随目标、眼高与观察角度。" }
  class n1 node_component
  n2@{ shape: stadium, label: "**Fire#lt;LookAction#gt;**<br/>通知目标控制者更新观察输入。" }
  class n2 node_event
  n3@{ shape: cyl, label: "**GameSettings**<br/>来自设置与参数 ↗：保存已应用的玩家设置<br/>与音量配置。" }
  class n3 node_resource
  class n3 external_node
  n4@{ shape: rounded, label: "**ControlsCamera**<br/>普通实体引用，指向受控相机。" }
  class n4 node_component
  n5@{ shape: rounded, label: "**MouseLookState**<br/>保存光标捕获与观察输入初始化状态。" }
  class n5 node_component
  n6@{ shape: cyl, label: "**Time**<br/>来自Bevy 引擎 ↗：提供当前运行阶段的通<br/>用时间。" }
  class n6 node_resource
  class n6 external_node
  n7@{ shape: notch-rect, label: "**Local#lt;f64#gt;（next_log_at）**<br/>保存连续观察角度日志的下次采样时间。" }
  class n7 node_local
  n8@{ shape: fr-rect, label: "**FirstPersonPlugin**<br/>管理玩法动作、光标捕获、朝向与第一人称镜<br/>头。" }
  class n8 node_plugin
